Z||000000||JohnnyK||12-01-2001||02:31 PM||||Alright.. I just found out the X-Box is the same price as the PS2, so now I have a real dilemma.. Ps2 or xbox.. pros and cons<P>x-box: Brand new, so might turn out to be amazing once they start making games<BR>More power.<BR>Controllers have a lot of functions<BR>Cons: Controllers feel like a big block of cheese (remind me of the dreamcast controllers)<BR>Not many games yet.<BR>None of the games I want (I don't think).. Grand Turismo 3, worms, etc..<P>PS2: Decent graphics, has some great games, obviously is widely supported.. and plays all my old PS1 games too. Controller is good..<P>Cons: 1 year old, so it might be pretty outdated.. Not as powerful, and graphics aren't quite as good. Controller might not have as many buttons and functions. But tons of games..<P>Also, I don't know if games are copyable for the xbox.. I will only buy a system if I can copy the games.||||reg||1
