Z||000011||AusFiero||12-03-2001||04:43 PM||||If software prices for PCs is anything to go by avoid the Xbox like the plague. The PS2 is a now machine with the backwards game compatibility and DVD. If you buy a machine now because there will be good games out in the future it also probably means your Xbox will be outdated by the time the good games are there.<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero3.gif">       <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
