Z||000013||falconhulk||12-03-2001||05:47 PM||||This all has been done in another thread.  Whatever you do do not listen to the guys that talk about it being a slow PC.  It has the best sound chip and graphics processor around.  Having a unfied platform where all games run optimized makes the xbox games look better then PC, except for the resoloution.  Almost all PC games will be released for it.  Console developers are releaseing games for it.  Developers have stated time and again its way beyond the PS2.  The creator of DOA 3 said it could ONLY be done on the xbox.  You get the great PC games plus the cool console games that make multiplayer (same room) so fun.  When developers do not have to test and change code to work on thousnads of diffrent configurations and worry about driver incompatibilities it changes the world.  The games look better , dont have the PC game bugs and are cheaper to develop.  ||||reg||1
Z||000014||lou_dias||12-03-2001||06:31 PM||||A problem/complaint from developers with the PS2 that same one that buried the Sega Saturn (that and lack of good licenses).  Lack of a good API from the manufacturer to take advantage of the hardware and make life easier on the programmer.  Sega did release a newer api hence the Virtua Fighter Remix and VF2.||||reg||1
